    "body": "Auto refers to one of the other states depending on the mode of the dialog (modal dialogs default to Close Request state, otherwise it defaults to None state).\n\nThey're not in the table because they don't have an associated keyword.\n\nPerhaps the table should list all states in which case I think \"No Keyword\" is the clearest indicator that this isn't a state directly tied to the attribute.",
