    "updated_at": "2025-10-01T16:15:35Z",
    "body": "Many attributes have states which are not enumerated in the table. The table enumerates the related keyword, as Luke mentions, but the prose below is able to map additional states. Some other examples of this:\n\n - `shadowrootmode` (which has the [`None`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-shadowrootmode-none-state) state),\n - `contenteditable` (which has the [`Inherit`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-contenteditable-inherit-state) state),\n - `spellcheck` (which has the [`Default`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-spellcheck-default-state) state),\n - `autocapitalize` (which has the [`Default`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#autocap-hint-default) state),\n - `draggable` (which has the [`Auto`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-draggable-auto-state) state),\n - `popover` (which has the [`No Popover`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-popover-none-state) state),\n - `crossorigin` (which has the [`None`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-crossorigin-none) state),\n - `translate` (which has the [`Inherit`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-translate-inherit-state) state),\n - `Dir` (which has the [`Undefined`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-dir-undefined-state) state),\n - `Scope` (which has the [`Auto`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-th-scope-auto-state) state),\n - button's `type` (which has the [`Auto`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-button-type-auto-state) state), \n\nI believe this to be comprehensive, but I may have missed some.\n\nI do agree though, it might be nicer if these were in the table.",
